      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 6 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_10__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_10__para_a__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_10__para_a__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (1)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_10__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_10__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “moneylender”, di mana-mana jua terdapat, dengan perkataan “licensee”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_10__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_10__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perenggan (c) dengan perenggan yang berikut: “ (c) a business name, whether of an individual or of a firm in which he is a partner, under which he or the firm has been registered— (i) in the case of Peninsular Malaysia and the Federal Territory of Labuan, under the Registration of Businesses Act 1956 [Act 197]; (ii) in the case of the State of Sabah, under the Trade Licensing Ordinance [Sabah Cap. 144]; and (iii) in the case of the State of Sarawak, the Businesses, Professions and Trade Licensing Ordinance [Sarawak Cap. 33] and the Business Names Ordinance [Sarawak Cap. 64]”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_10__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (2), dengan menggantikan perkataan “moneylender’s” dengan perkataan “licensee’s”. Pindaan seksyen 8"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 8 Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “any person” dengan perkataan “a licensee”. Pindaan seksyen 9a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 9a Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “moneylender”, di mana-mana jua terdapat, dengan perkataan “licensee”. Pindaan seksyen 9f"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_13__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_13__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 9f Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_13__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (2), dengan menggantikan perkataan “person” dengan perkataan “licensee”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_13__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_13",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (2) subseksyen yang berikut: “(3) A licensee may surrender his licence on his own initiative by forwarding the licence to the Registrar with a written notice of the surrender of the licence. (4) The surrender of the licence shall take effect fourteen days from the date the Registrar receives the licence and the written notice or such other date as may be specified by the Registrar. (5) Upon the surrender of the licence under this section, the Registrar shall not refund any fees paid by the licensee under subsections 5b(3) and 5e(4).”. Seksyen baru 9h"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 9g seksyen yang berikut: “Approval and notification of change of profile 9h. (1) Every licensee shall obtain the approval of the Registrar— (a) before changing his business name; (b) before the employment, appointment or admission of any person who will be responsible for the management of the licensee’s business of moneylending; or (c) before any person becomes a director or partner of the licensee. (2) Every licensee shall notify the Registrar, in writing, as soon as practicable— (a) of any person becoming a substantial shareholder of the licensee; or (b) of any substantial shareholder of the licensee increasing or reducing his substantial shareholding in the licensee. (3) Every licensee shall notify the Registrar, in writing— (a) of any person ceasing to be a director, partner or substantial shareholder of the licensee; or (b) of any person ceasing to be responsible for the management of the business of moneylending of the licensee, not later than fourteen days after the cessation. (4) Every licensee shall notify the Registrar, in writing, of a bankruptcy order against the licensee, or any director, partner or substantial shareholder of the licensee, not later than fourteen days after the bankruptcy order is made. (5) Any licensee who contravenes subsection (1), (2), (3) or (4) shall be guilty of an offence under this Act and shall be liable to a fine not exceeding fifty thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding twelve months or to both.”. Pindaan seksyen 10b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "hasPart": [
