      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 10b Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_15__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (4), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “Registrar” perkataan “or in a book to be kept by an officer in charge of a police station”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_15__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (4) subseksyen yang berikut: “(4a) A copy, which is certified to be a true copy by the Registrar or an officer in charge of a police district, of an entry under subsection (4) shall be admissible as evidence of the contents of the original and of the time, place and manner in which the complaint was recorded.”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_15__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (5), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “police officer” perkataan “not below the rank of Sergeant”. Pindaan seksyen 10d"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_16",
