    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_16__para_c__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_16__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “An Inspector or police officer” dengan perkataan “An Inspector or a senior police officer”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_16__para_c__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_16__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “police officer” dengan perkataan “senior police officer”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_16__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_16",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (5), dengan menggantikan perkataan “police officer” dengan perkataan “senior police officer”. Pindaan seksyen 10e"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan seksyen 10e dengan seksyen yang berikut: “Power of arrest 10e. (1) An Inspector or a police officer may arrest without warrant any person who commits or attempts to commit, or whom the Inspector or police officer reasonably suspects of committing or attempting to commit, any offence under this Act. (2) Where any person is arrested under subsection (1), he shall thereafter be dealt with as provided by the Criminal Procedure Code [Act 593].”. Pindaan seksyen 10f"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 10f Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “police officer”, di mana-mana jua terdapat, dengan perkataan “senior police officer”. Pindaan seksyen 10g"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_19__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_19__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 10g Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_19__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (1), dengan menggantikan perkataan “police officer” dengan perkataan “a senior police officer”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_19__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (2), dengan menggantikan perkataan “police officer” dengan perkataan “senior police officer”. Seksyen baru 10ga dan 10gb"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini bolehlah dinamakan Akta Pemberi Pinjam Wang (Pindaan) 2010."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini mula berkuat kuasa pada tarikh yang ditetapkan oleh Menteri melalui pemberitahuan dalam Warta. Pindaan am"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Pemberi Pinjam Wang 1951 [Akta 400], yang disebut “Akta ibu” dalam Akta ini, dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “holder of the licence”, di mana-mana jua terdapat, dengan perkataan “licensee”. Pindaan seksyen 1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 10g seksyen yang berikut: “Additional powers 10ga. (1) Notwithstanding sections 10d and 10f, an Inspector or a senior police officer shall, for the execution of this Act, have power to do all or any of the following: (a) to visit, enter, inspect and examine with or without notice any premises where a moneylender is or is believed to be carrying on business; (b) to require the production of any information, book, record or other document kept by a moneylender or other person and to inspect, examine, make copies of them and take extracts from them; (c) to take photographs of the premises inspected or any part of the premises; (d) to seize and remove from the premises any book, record or other document, or any machine or equipment containing any book, record or other document; and (e) make such inquiry as may be necessary to ascertain whether the provisions of this Act have been complied with. (2) Where any book, record or other document, or any machine or equipment containing any book, record or other document is seized under paragraph (1)(d), the seizing officer shall prepare a list of the things seized and immediately deliver a copy signed by him to the moneylender, or to the moneylender’s officer or employee, at the premises. Access to computerized data 10gb. (1) An Inspector or a senior police officer conducting a search under this Act shall be given access to computerized data whether stored in a computer or otherwise. (2) For the purpose of this section, “access”— (a) includes being provided with the necessary password, encryption code, decryption code, software or hardware and any other means required to enable comprehension of such computerized data; and (b) has the same meaning assigned to it by subsections 2(2) and (5) of the Computer Crimes Act 1997 [Act 563].”. Pindaan seksyen 10h"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_21",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "21",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_21__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_21__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 10h Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_21__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (1), dengan menggantikan perkataan “police officer” dengan perkataan “a senior police officer”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_21__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_21",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (2), dengan menggantikan perkataan “police officer” dengan perkataan “senior police officer”. Pindaan seksyen 10j"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_22",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "22",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan seksyen 10j dengan seksyen yang berikut: “Authority to act 10j. (1) There shall be issued to each Inspector an authority card to be signed by the Minister. (2) Whenever an Inspector exercises any of the powers under this Act, he shall on demand produce to the person against whom the power is being exercised the authority card issued to him under subsection (1).”. Pindaan seksyen 10k"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_23",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "23",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_23__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_23__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 10k(1) Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_23__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_23",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “police officer” yang terdapat selepas perkataan “an Inspector or” dengan perkataan “a senior police officer”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_23__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_23",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “police officer” yang terdapat selepas perkataan “superior in rank to the” dengan perkataan “senior police officer”. Seksyen baru 10oa, 10ob dan 10oc"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_24",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "24",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 10o seksyen yang berikut: “Presumption as to the business of moneylending 10oa. Where in any proceedings against any person, it is alleged that such person is a moneylender, the proof of a single loan at interest made by such person shall raise a presumption that such person is carrying on the business of moneylending, until the contrary is proved. Evidence and records of previous conviction 10ob. (1) For the purposes of sentencing under this Act, when it is necessary to prove in any court that the offence for which a person is being convicted is a second or subsequent offence, a certificate purporting to be a record of his previous conviction, signed by— (a) the Registrar; or (b) any police officer authorized in writing in that behalf by the Chief Police Officer or Commissioner of Police, having custody of the records in which such conviction is kept, shall be admissible as evidence and shall constitute prima facie proof of any fact stated therein. (2) The certificate under subsection (1) shall only be admissible if it is a record in respect of the same offence and the conviction is obtained within five years from the date of the present conviction. Diary of proceedings in investigation 10oc. (1) Every Inspector or police officer making an investigation under this Act shall day by day enter his proceedings in the investigation in a diary setting forth— (a) the time at which the order to investigate, if any, reached him; (b) the time at which he began and closed the investigation; (c) the place or places visited by him; and (d) a statement of the circumstances ascertained through his investigation. (2) Notwithstanding anything contained in the Evidence Act 1950 [Act 56], an accused person shall not be entitled, either before or in the course of any proceedings under this Act, to call for or inspect any such diary: Provided that if the Inspector or police officer who has made the investigation refers to the diary for the purposes of section 159 or 160 of the Evidence Act 1950, only such entries as the officer has referred to shall be shown to the accused, and the court shall at the request of the Inspector or police officer cause any other entries to be concealed from view or obliterated.”. Pindaan seksyen 10p"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_25",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "25",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 10p Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “moneylender”, di mana-mana jua terdapat, dengan perkataan “licensee”. Pindaan seksyen 11"
      }
    },
