        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 25 Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “moneylender”, di mana-mana jua terdapat, dengan perkataan “licensee”. Pindaan seksyen 26"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_37",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "37",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 26 Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “moneylender”, di mana-mana jua terdapat, dengan perkataan “licensee”. Seksyen baru 27a dan 27b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_38",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "38",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 27 seksyen yang berikut: “Prohibition of employing an agent or canvasser 27a. (1) No moneylender shall employ any agent or canvasser for the purpose of inviting any person to borrow money or to enter into any transaction involving the borrowing of money from a moneylender. (2) No person shall act as agent or canvasser, or demand or receive directly or indirectly any sum or other value consideration by way of commission or otherwise for introducing or undertaking to introduce to a moneylender any person desiring to borrow money. (2) Any person who contravenes subsections (1) and (2) shall be guilty of an offence under this Act and shall be liable to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to a fine not exceeding fifty thousand ringgit or to both. Moneylending agreement in which amount is not truly stated or left blank 27b. Any licensee who prepares any moneylending agreement under section 16 in which the principal or rate of interest is not truly stated or is left blank to be filled after the execution of the moneylending agreement shall be guilty of an offence under this Act and shall be liable to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years or to a fine not exceeding twenty thousand ringgit or to both.”. Pindaan seksyen 29a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_39",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
