      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (5) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(5) All monies paid to the Registrar or to an Inspector specifically authorized under subsection (1) shall be paid into and form part of— (a) in the case of Peninsular Malaysia and the Federal Territory of Labuan, the Federal Consolidated Fund; and (b) in the case of the States of Sabah and Sarawak, the State Consolidated Fund of the State respectively.”. Pindaan seksyen 29h"
      }
