      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 29h seksyen yang berikut: “Reward to informer 29i. (1) The Registrar may reward such amount of money to any informer whose information leads to the conviction of any person for an offence under this Act. (2) The reward made under subsection (1) shall be paid from— (a) in the case of Peninsular Malaysia and the Federal Territory of Labuan, the Federal Consolidated Fund; and (b) in the case of the States of Sabah and Sarawak, the State Consolidated Fund of the State respectively. Assignment of proceeds to the States of Sabah and Sarawak 29j. The following proceeds are assigned to the States of Sabah and Sarawak: (a) penalties for late renewal of licence under section 5e; and (b) fees for advertisement permits as prescribed under the Moneylenders (Control and Licensing) Regulations 2003 [P.U. (A) 400/2003]. Power to amend First Schedule 29k. The Minister may, by order published in the Gazette, amend the First Schedule.”. Penggantian Jadual Pertama"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_45",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "45",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan Jadual Pertama dengan Jadual yang berikut: “FIRST S CHEDULE [Subsection 2a(1)] 1. Any authority or body established, appointed or constituted by any written law, including any local authority. 2. Any co-operative society registered under the Co-operative Societies Act 1993 [Act 502]. 3. Any licensed bank or licensed merchant bank as defined under the Banking and Financial Institutions Act 1989 [Act 372] or any Islamic bank as defined under the Islamic Banking Act 1983 [Act 276]. 4. Any insurance company licensed under the Insurance Act 1996 [Act 553]. 5. Any company licensed under the Takaful Act 1984 [Act 314]. 6. Any pawnbroker licensed under the Pawnbrokers Act 1972 [Act 81]. 7. A development financial institution prescribed under the Development Financial Institutions Act 2001 [Act 618]. 8. A licensed finance company as defined under subsection 2(1) of the Banking and Financial Institutions Act 1989. 9. Any company who lends money to its related corporation as defined under the Companies Act 1965 [Act 125]. 10. Any company who lends money to its director, officer or employee as a benefit accorded to such person under his terms of employment. 11. Any person who subscribes or purchases debt securities which include— (a) stocks issued under the Loan (Local) Act 1959 [Act 637]; (b) Treasury Bills issued under the Treasury Bills (Local) Act 1946 [Act 188]; (c) investments under the Government Funding Act 1983 [Act 275]; and (d) debentures as defined under section 2 of the Capital Markets and Services Act 2007 [Act 671]. 12. Any person licensed, registered or regulated under the Capital Markets and Services Act 2007. 13. Any scheduled institution as defined under the Banking and Financial Institutions Act 1989. 14. Any company who is an issuer of a credit card or charge card approved under the Payment System Act 2003 [Act 627]. 15. Any Labuan bank as defined under the Labuan Financial Services and Securities Act 2010 [Act 704]. 16. Any company who is licensed under Part VII of the Labuan Financial Services and Securities Act 2010.”. Jadual Pertama A baru"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_46",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "46",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas Jadual Pertama Jadual yang berikut: “FIRST S CHEDULE A [Section 19] TABLE 1 PRINCIPAL AND INTEREST Principal Date on which loan was Rate per centum per made annum or the Amount of TABLE 2 REPAYMENT Amounts repaid Date 1. 2. 3. 4. 5. 6. TABLE 3 AMOUNT OF ARREARS Principal Date due Interest 1. 2. 3. 4. 5. 6. 7. TABLE 4 SUMS NOT YET DUE Principal Date due Interest 1. 2. 3. 4. 5. 6. 7. ”. Pembatalan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_47",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "47",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Perintah Wilayah Persekutuan Labuan (Pemeluasan dan Ubah Suaian Akta Pemberi Pinjam Wang 1951) 2007 [P.U. (A) 413/2007] dan Perintah Negeri-Negeri Sabah dan Sarawak (Pemeluasan dan Ubah Suaian Akta Pemberi Pinjam Wang 1951) 2007 [P.U. (A) 414/2007] dibatalkan."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_4__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan sebelum takrif ‘ “authorized name” and “authorized address” ’ takrif yang berikut: ‘ “Authority” has the same meaning assigned to it in the Local Government Ordinance 1961 [Sabah Ord. 11/1961];’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_4__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas takrif “licence” takrif yang berikut: ‘ “licensee” means any moneylender to whom a licence has been issued under section 5b; “local authority” has the same meaning assigned to it in the Local Authorities Ordinance 1996 [Sarawak Ord. 20/1996];’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_4__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan takrif “moneylender” dengan takrif yang berikut: ‘ “moneylender” means any person who carries on or advertises or announces himself or holds himself out in any way as carrying on the business of moneylending, whether or not he carries on any other business;’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_4__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas takrif “moneylender” takrif yang berikut: ‘ “moneylending” means the lending of money at interest, with or without security, by a moneylender to a borrower;’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_4__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas takrif “moneylending agreement” takrif yang berikut: ‘ “Perbadanan Labuan” has the same meaning assigned to it in the Perbadanan Labuan Act 2001 [Act 609];” ’; (f) dalam takrif “police officer”, dengan memotong perkataan “senior”; dan (g) dengan memasukkan selepas takrif “Registrar” takrif yang berikut: ‘ “senior police officer” means a senior police officer as defined in the Police Act 1967;’. Pindaan seksyen 2a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 2a Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan subseksyen (1) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(1) This Act shall not apply to a person specified in the First Schedule, and such person shall be subject to any written law governing his business or activity.”. Pindaan seksyen 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 4(1) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “public service” perkataan “, officer of Perbadanan Labuan in the Federal Territory of Labuan, officer of the Authority in the State of Sabah and officer of the local authority in the State of Sarawak” . Pindaan seksyen 4a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 4a(2) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “public officer” perkataan “, officer of Perbadanan Labuan in the Federal Territory of Labuan, officer of the Authority in the State of Sabah and officer of the local authority in the State of Sarawak” . Pindaan seksyen 5"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/msa@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
